  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759135,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde - 100 Classic Book Collection (Nintendo DS)\n\nDelve into Robert Louis Stevenson's chilling novella, *The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde*, as part of the 100 Classic Book Collection for the Nintendo DS. Experience this gripping tale of a respected London doctor who unleashes his darker side through a dangerous experiment, transforming into the monstrous Mr. Hyde.\n\nThis e-book collection brings classic literature to life on your DS, allowing you to hold the device like a traditional book. Adjust text size, customize background music, and use the bookmark feature to track your progress. Utilize the search function to quickly locate this and other literary gems by genre, author, or length. Discover fascinating introductions and author biographies to enrich your reading experience. \n\nThe game’s unique personality quiz might even suggest *Jekyll and Hyde* as a perfect read! Share \"trial versions\" with friends via local Wi-Fi and immerse yourself in Stevenson’s suspenseful narrative, all within the convenience of a single DS cartridge. A truly portable literary adventure awaits."
    },
